ISO-10303-21;
/* Tfa045 - Multiple wires of a face intersect at a single point
 * Defect: one face has three wires; two of them touch at one point in UV
 * (tangent rather than crossing). The kernel must distinguish a tangent
 * touch from a crossing and decide whether to merge the wires. */
